---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { href } from "../lib/paths";
---
<Layout title="Our Care | Kin & Campus">
<div class="w ph"><div class="eyebrow">Our care</div><h1>Managing their ongoing care, right here in Blacksburg.</h1><p class="lead">Whether they're managing asthma, ADHD, thyroid care, or anxiety, continuity shouldn't lapse when they leave home. We handle ongoing medication management, prescription refills, and clinical oversight through every semester, holiday break, and exam week—keeping parents in the loop when something changes.</p></div>
<div class="w"><img class="photo" src={href("photos/campus-aerial.jpg")} width="800" height="450" alt="Campus and the surrounding hills, seen from above">
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg><h3>Seamless chronic condition management</h3><p>Your established treatment plan stays active and monitored. A board-certified pediatrician holds and executes the care plan locally while they live on or near campus.</p></div>
<div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-moon"/></svg><h3>Proactive clinical check-ins</h3><p>Intentional touchpoints timed around high-stress windows—midterms, finals, holiday returns, and seasonal adjustments—so small issues are caught early.</p></div>
<div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg><h3>Direct, unhurried sick visits</h3><p>When acute illness hits, they see a doctor who already knows their baseline history—with same-day or next-day availability right in town.</p></div>
<div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-leaf"/></svg><h3>Building adult health independence</h3><p>College is where healthcare transitions from parents managing logistics to young adults owning it. We coach them on navigating appointments, refill timelines, and recognizing when to ask for help.</p></div>
<div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-compass"/></svg><h3>Integrated hometown communication</h3><p>Their primary care provider or hometown pediatrician is designated on day one, copied on clinical notes, and sent a comprehensive year-end summary every May.</p></div>
<div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chat"/></svg><h3>Direct physician access</h3><p>Direct text communication with a board-certified pediatrician based in Blacksburg—just eight minutes from campus—eliminating call centers and nurse triage mazes.</p></div></div></div>
<section><div class="w split"><svg class="art" viewBox="0 0 360 360" role="img" aria-label="Portrait placeholder"><rect width="360" height="360" rx="28" fill="#EADFCB"/><circle cx="180" cy="140" r="56" fill="#9CAF98"/><path d="M70 330q110-150 220 0z" fill="#6B2737"/><circle cx="270" cy="86" r="20" fill="none" stroke="#C9A24B" stroke-width="8"/></svg>
<div><div class="eyebrow">The physician</div><h2>Practicing local pediatric care for Virginia Tech students.</h2><p class="lead">Built specifically for Virginia Tech students and the parents 250 miles away who want peace of mind. As a board-certified pediatrician living and practicing right here in Blacksburg, care is delivered with direct physician access, rapid communication, and immediate coordination with your family's hometown physician.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding-top:0"><div class="w"><div class="eyebrow">A year in town</div><h2>Care from August through May.</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="num">August</div><p>Initial parent intake conversation, followed by an in-person baseline visit with the student to establish rapport before classes start.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="num">The Semester</div><p>Ongoing management for acute sick visits, prescription refills, and structured check-ins around holiday transitions.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="num">Finals</div><p>Proactive wellness evaluations focusing on sleep hygiene, acute stress load, and medication adherence during high-stakes testing weeks.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="num">May</div><p>Comprehensive annual clinical summary transmitted to the hometown physician so August transitions seamlessly.</p></div></div>
<p style="margin-top:36px"><a class="btn" href={href("join")}>Reserve a spot</a></p></div></section>
</Layout>
